		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Evaluated Nuclear Data File</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">ENDF</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://www-nds.iaea.org/exfor/endf.htm</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">Core nuclear reaction database contain recommended, evaluated cross sections, spectra, angular distributions, fission product yields, photo-atomic and thermal scattering law data, with emphasis on neutron induced reactions. The data were analyzed by experienced nuclear physicists to produce recommended libraries for one of the national nuclear data projects (USA, Europe, Japan, Russia and China). All data are stored in the internationally-adopted ENDF-6 format maintained by CSEWG.</r3d:description>
